    "text": "By STAFF REPORTS ,\n8 hours ago ASHLAND, Ky. (WCHS) — Officials in Ashland, Ky., are asking for the public’s help finding a man who hasn’t been seen or heard from in a week. Alvin Perkins, 56, of Ashland walked away from his residence on 24th Street on April 29 and has been missing ever since, according to a news release from the Ashland-Boyd County-Catlettsburg Office of Emergency Management. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
